{"detail":"Godot's DAP endpoint does not debug C#; use Visual Studio, Rider, or VS Code with a .NET debugger","docs_url":"https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.html#configuring-an-external-editor","error":"csharp_debug_unsupported","guidance":["Visual Studio: open the project's solution and use its Godot C# debug target","Rider: open the project and use its Godot run/debug configuration","VS Code: configure a .NET launch/attach target as described in the linked Godot C# documentation"],"ok":false}
